 "config": {
  "comment": "raw -> value * factor + offset; \"invalid\" = the car's \"no value\". Speed and acceleration scaling as in the idrive7-apps kit. The yaw rate, the steering, the pedal and the wheels have no scaling here: the app learns them (apps/pps_drift/learn.js). None of it has been measured by Proven.",
  "scaling": {
   "speed": {
    "factor": 0.015625,
    "offset": 0,
    "invalid": 65535,
    "unit": "km/h",
    "member": "speedVehicleCentreOfGravity"
   },
   "lat": {
    "factor": 0.002,
    "offset": -65,
    "invalid": 65535,
    "unit": "m/s2",
    "member": "lateralAccelerationCentreOfGravity"
   },
   "long": {
    "factor": 0.002,
    "offset": -65,
    "invalid": 65535,
    "unit": "m/s2",
    "member": "longitudinalAccelerationCentreOfGravity"
   }
  }
